I remember the grid bug scene.  Tron and the gang are looking down on
this grid plane (more of a plains, actually).  The grid came to life,
with these great big bugs jumping out of it and running around.  They
looked like spiders.  I remember the characters mentioning that they
were very nasty.

You have to fight grid bugs in the Tron video game.  They multiply
like crazy and you have to get past a swarm of them.  This is probably
where the dev team got the idea for the monster.  Hey...multiplying
grid bugs for 3.1...none of them really nasty by themselves, but how
do you ever get rid of all of them?  Heck, brown puddings and gremlins
can multiply.

